  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling Up Innovative Approaches to Respond to TB Challenges in Afghanistan - Afghanistan (01-Apr-2015-31-Dec-2017)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Afghanistan, Tuberculosis, Ministry of Public Health of the Islamic Republic of Afghanistan (MoPH)This program has the following goals: To reduce TB mortality by 50% at the end of 2018 compared to 2013. The objectives of this program are: To detect and treat at least 50% of estimated MDR-TB cases by 2018.  To increase the case notification of all TB cases at least 6 % by year and to maintain treatment success rate, at least, 90% by 2018</narrative>
  </description>
